(905578, 'Italian - Speaking Customer Service Representative | Healthcare Technology | Athens', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/9cffbf70-ab93-4d68-b151-c23f4128eabe/', 'ΑΘΗΝΑ - ΑΤΤΙΚΗ', '2026-03-30', '2026-03-30 09:01:44', 'MANPOWER GROUP', ' Περιγραφή  Are you passionate about delivering exceptional customer support and making a real impact on people’s lives? 🎯 Do you speak  Italian and  English fluently? 🔊 Would you like to join a global leader in healthcare technology with strong career development opportunities? 📈 Manpower Group  Greece, on behalf of its client, a global leader in  Healthcare  Technology, is looking for an  Italian- Speaking  Customer  Service  Representative to join their team.📌  Location:  Athens,  Greece📍  Working  Model:  Hybrid (on-site during training)🕘  Working  Hours:  Monday –  Friday, 10:00 – 19:00 (1 hour daily break included)📄  Contract:  Permanent,  Full-time What you will do:      Provide high-quality support to patients using advanced diabetes management technologies, ensuring a smooth onboarding experience and ongoing assistance. More specifically:  Deliver reliable customer support to  Diabetes patients in  Greece and  Italy Provide technical and administrative support related to company products Guide patients through onboarding via inbound and outbound communication Handle inquiries and resolve issues following internal processes and quality standards Build strong relationships with patients and support them throughout their therapy journey Demonstrate empathy, patience, and professionalism in every interaction Accurately document all interactions in  C R M systems Collaborate with internal teams to ensure seamless communication  Απαραίτητα  Προσόντα  Bachelor’s degree or  High  School diploma Fluency in  Italian and  English ( Greek is a plus) Previous experience in customer service, contact center, or support roles (preferred) Strong communication and interpersonal skills High level of empathy and emotional intelligence Good knowledge of  M S  Office Ability to multitask and work in a structured environment Team-oriented mindset and strong organizational skills  Παροχές ✔️  Competitive compensation package🥗  Monthly meal vouchers ( Ticket  Restaurant)🩺  Private  Health  Insurance📖  Continuous training in an innovative multinational working environment🌍  Opportunity to contribute to meaningful healthcare solutions👥  Recruitment  Process: If you’re interested in this role, feel free to apply directly.  Our consultants will contact the candidates who meet the profile’s requirements to arrange an interview.# Empoweringtalent # Webelievein Talent # Manpower Group Greece', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση | Hybrid'),
(905579, 'Λάντζα / Καθαρίστρια', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/b912e8af-60c5-450a-b20e-04758e3b4d7b/', 'ΝΙΚΙΑΝΑ | ΛΕΥΚΑΔΑ', '2026-03-30', '2026-03-30 09:01:46', 'NV BEACH BAR RESTAURANT', ' Περιγραφή  Ζητούνται  Καθαρίστριες /  Λάντζα στη  Νικιάνα   Λευκάδας για την καλοκαιρινή σεζόν 2026.  Απαραίτητα  Προσόντα  Εμπειρία σε αντίστοιχη θέση  Παροχές  Διαμονή Διατροφή', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
