(907034, 'HR Administrator', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/2d640890-c335-4a16-b8c0-aae1bab619e0/', 'ΧΑΛΑΝΔΡΙ | ΑΘΗΝΑ - ΑΤΤΙΚΗ', '2026-03-31', '2026-03-31 17:03:25', 'ADECCO Human Resource Services', ' Περιγραφή  Adecco  H R is the global leader in  H R services, certified in  Greece with  I S O 9001:2015 in the field of search and selection services and temporary placement.  Adecco, on behalf of a leading multinational company in the information technology and enterprise solutions sector, is seeking to recruit a highly motivated professional for the following position based in  Athens: H R  Administrator Key  Responsibilities:•  Support employees’ onboarding and offboarding processes and liaise with the  People  Services team•  Assist in the implementation and monitoring of  Digital  Card processes•  Support internal communication initiatives across  E M E A (announcements, newsletters, updates)•  Update corporate policies and maintain relevant documentation on the company portal•  Handle employee inquiries regarding private medical and pension programs•  Support communication and coordination with the external payroll provider•  Maintain and organize  H R department documentation and records•  Assist in employee engagement and wellness initiatives  Απαραίτητα  Προσόντα  Requirements:• 1–2 years of experience in a similar  H R role•  Bachelor’s degree in  Business  Administration or a related field•  Fluency in  English (written and spoken)•  Good knowledge of  M S  Office applications•  Strong organizational and communication skills•  Ability to manage multiple tasks and work effectively in a team environment  Παροχές  The  Company  Offers:•  Competitive remuneration package•  Private medical plan and meal vouchers•  Hybrid working model (2 days office / 3 days remote)•  Exposure to an international and dynamic working environment•  Fixed-term contract with potential for extension After the screening of the  C Vs, we will contact the candidates who meet the profile’s requirements to arrange an interview. All applications are considered strictly confidential.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(907035, 'Barista - Προετοιμασία Ροφημάτων', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/2c19d9ec-abac-4084-a4ae-acc9da198f35/', 'ΚΕΝΤΡΟ ΘΕΣΣΑΛΟΝΙΚΗΣ | ΘΕΣΣΑΛΟΝΙΚΗ', '2026-03-31', '2026-03-31 17:03:26', 'ΠΑΡΑΔΟΣΙΑΚΟ', ' Περιγραφή  Για τα καταστήματα  Π Α Ρ Α Δ Ο Σ Ι Α Κ Ο στο κέντρο της  Θεσσαλονίκης, αναζητούμε barista για προετοιμασία καφέ - ροφημάτων με εμπειρία.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
