les and satisfaction. D Y N A M I C  W O R K  E N V I R O N M E N T -  Say goodbye to monotony!  Our office is a hub of energy, where each day brings new challenges and opportunities for growth.  You\'ll be part of a supportive team that values creativity and collaboration. D R I V E  D I V E R S I T Y -  At  Hertz, we offer a car fleet that covers every taste and need.  From sleek hatchbacks to spacious  S U Vs, our collection is as diverse as our team. B R A N D  R E C O G N I T I O N -  Be part of an international organization with presence in 9 countries, 160 sales points, a fleet of over 55.000 vehicles and 1.700 employees at the core of its business. T R A I N I N G -  We believe in investing in our team.  You\'ll receive comprehensive on-site and online training to master the art of sales and customer service, ensuring you have all the support needed for a smooth and confident start. D E V E L O P M E N T -  Be the first candidate to apply and explore career development opportunities our company has to offer. Join us in making every journey an adventure!', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
