(908997, 'Junior Design Engineer', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/e84f4743-8eaa-44d9-a5c4-c9a1d4276d70/', 'ΝΑΥΠΑΚΤΟΣ', '2026-04-03', '2026-04-03 09:00:58', 'ΠΛΑΣΤΙΚΑ ΚΟΤΡΩΝΗΣ', ' Περιγραφή  We are seeking a motivated and well-organized  Junior  Design  Engineer to join our  Product  Design team.  The successful candidate will work closely with the  Senior  Design  Engineer, supporting both the design and coordination of new product development projects, ensuring smooth communication, accurate project tracking, and adherence to timelines.  Your  Responsibilities:3 D design of products and components using  C A D software Support the coordination of new product development projects from customer request to final delivery Work closely with the  Senior  Design  Engineer to monitor project progress and ensure alignment with technical requirements Register and maintain project data in the company’s project management platform Track project timelines, update statuses, and follow up on key milestones (design, mold construction, production) Act as a communication link between internal departments ( R& D,  Production, and  Quality) Assist in the preparation and updating of  Technical  Specifications and project documentation Ensure compliance with the  Company’s  Quality  Assurance  System    Απαραίτητα  Προσόντα  Requirements: Degree in  Mechanical  Engineering or a related field Very good knowledge of 3 D design software ( C A D) Familiarity with project management tools or  E R P systems will be considered an asset Previous experience in a similar role is a plus Very good command of  English ( German will be considered an asset) Ability to travel within  Greece or abroad Strong organizational and coordination skills Attention to detail and ability to manage structured data Good communication and teamwork abilities Willingness to learn and grow within a project-oriented environment  Παροχές  We  Offer: Excellent working conditions and a friendly work environment The opportunity to work in a state-of-the-art environment, actively contributing to new product development and growing professionally within the company Continuous training and exposure to leading manufacturers across  Europe Private health insurance Competitive remuneration package Monthly  Ticket  Restaurant card  If you are eager to start your career in  Product  Design within a dynamic manufacturing environment, please submit your  C V.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(908998, 'Υπάλληλος Διοικητικής Υποστήριξης', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/2566b259-ec0e-4575-9690-cac71a95495a/', 'NEO ΗΡΑΚΛΕΙΟ, ΑΤΤΙΚΗΣ | ΑΘΗΝΑ - ΑΤΤΙΚΗ', '2026-04-03', '2026-04-03 09:01:00', 'ΜΑΣΤΕΡ ΚΕΝΤΡΟ ΚΑΤΑΡΤΙΣΗΣ ΚΑΙ ΣΥΜΒΟΥΛΕΥΤΙΚΗΣ', ' Περιγραφή  Ο όμιλος  Master ( Κ Δ Β Μ,  Ι Ε Κ,  A C A D E M Y) διευρύνει το ανθρώπινο δυναμικό του και αναζητά  Υπάλληλο  Διοικητικής  Υποστήριξης με απογευματινό ωράριο εργασίας, πλήρους απασχόλησης, για τη  M A S T E R στην  Αθήνα ( Πλησίον σταθμού  Η Σ Α Π/ Μετρό). Αρμοδιότητες: Υποστήριξη στην υλοποίηση προγραμμάτων κατάρτισης /εκπαίδευσης Τηλεφωνική προώθηση  Εκπαιδευτικών  Προγραμμάτων Τηλεφωνική ενημέρωση  Επιδοτούμενων  Προγραμμάτων  Απαραίτητα  Προσόντα  Απόφοιτος  Α Ε Ι /  Τ Ε Ι Επιθυμητή σχετική εμπειρία Καλή γνώση  Microsoft  Office (excel, world, outlook) Γνώση  Αγγλικών Πολύ καλή δυνατότητα επικοινωνίας', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
