(926714, 'Αρχιτέκτων Διακοσμήτρια', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/8e516c37-2e3b-42eb-862f-ea323009be7d/', 'ΚΑΒΑΛΑΡΙ | ΘΕΣΣΑΛΟΝΙΚΗ', '2026-04-20', '2026-04-20 17:05:15', 'ΚΑΡΑΠΙΠΕΡΙΔΗΣ-ΠΑΡΙΤΣΗΣ ΕΠΙΠΛΟΠΟΙΙΑ', ' Περιγραφή  Η εταιρεία  Κ Α Ρ Α Π Ι Π Ε Ρ Ι Δ Η Σ  Ν. -  Π Α Ρ Ι Τ Σ Η Σ  Σ.  Ο. Ε αναζητά  Αρχιτέκτων/ Διακοσμήτρια με εμπειρία στο τμήμα σχεδιασμού. Θέση εργασίας πλήρους απασχόλησης. Παρακαλούνται οι υποψήφιοι-ες να επικοινωνήσουν στο 6970100351.  Απαραίτητα  Προσόντα  Άριστη γνώση  Autocad,  Sketch  Up, 3 Ds  Max. Άριστη χρήση  Η/ Υ και  M S  Office. Καλή γνώση της  Αγγλικής  Γλώσσας. Ικανότητες σε γραμματειακή υποστήριξη. Μεταφορικό μέσο. Διάθεση για εργασία.  Παροχές  Δυνατότητα πολύ καλών αποδοχών αναλόγως των προσόντων, γνώσεων, έμπνευσης και δυνατοτήτων.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(926715, 'Receptionist', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/d71c36ae-9520-49d3-ac9e-705d266c65d3/', 'ΖΑΚΥΝΘΟΣ', '2026-04-20', '2026-04-20 17:05:17', 'LESANTE COLLECTION', ' Περιγραφή  Lesante  Collection is looking to recruit for season 2026 a passionate: Front  Office  Agent High-end hospitality group,  Lesante  Collection  Luxury  Resorts &  Villas is comprised of the three five-star luxury hotels on the island of  Zakynthos representing a trilogy of exceptional hospitality and absolute comfort for all.  The  Group is both family-owned and a proud ambassador for the island’s riches, a characteristic that shines through  Lesante  Classic,  Lesante  Blu and  Lesante  Cape, the three  Lesante  Collection resorts. Each hotel is inspires by the lands of  Zakynthos in its own right and invites guests to become immersed in the lush nature, inspiring traditions and authentic lifestyle of the finest  Ionian  Island. Key responsibilities: Responsible for processing check-ins and check outs correctly Collaboration with the reservation and housekeeping department Respond to requests or complaints, with customer-oriented approach Understand the needs of each customer Inform the guests about the facilities and services of the hotel Greet and welcome guests as soon as they arrive at the hotel Provide a friendly and efficient service at all times Requirements: Degree in  Hospitality or  Tourism  Management2 years minimum experience in the guest relation department in a 5-star hotel Excellent command of both  English and  Greek language is essential, knowledge of other is a plus. Ability to adjust to the culture and the standards of the hotel brand Communication and leadership skills, teamwork, pleasant personality Knowledge of  Fidelio / Excellent computer skills,  M S  Office ( Word,  Excel) Benefits: Competitive remuneration package Accommodation On-the-job training Career development opportunities Positive work environment Should you wish to be a member of  Lesante  Collection team, please send us your  C V with a photo. All applications will be treated in the strictest confidence.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
