(929591, 'Front Office Agent', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/1dc98650-383a-44cd-bd1a-f59e879dffb6/', 'ΝΑΟΥΣΑ | ΠΑΡΟΣ', '2026-04-23', '2026-04-23 17:01:50', 'COVE PAROS', ' Περιγραφή  Cove  Paros is seeking a  Front  Office  Agent to join our team for the summer season of 2026. About  Cove  Paros 5*  Cove  Hotel 5*  Paros is a luxurious beachfront resort located on the picturesque island of  Paros,  Greece.  Cove  Hotel offers guests an unforgettable experience in a stunning  Mediterranean setting. Key  Responsibilities: Greet and welcome guests with a smile and a positive attitude upon their arrival Check-in and check-out guests efficiently, ensuring all necessary information is accurately recorded Assist guests with inquiries, requests, and reservations, both in person and over the phone Handle guest complaints and concerns with professionalism and empathy, finding appropriate solutions to ensure guest satisfaction Provide information about hotel facilities, services, and local attractions Maintain a neat and organized front desk area Uphold the highest standards of guest service and professionalism at all times We are seeking a talented and passionate  Front  Office  Agent to join our world-class team.  As a  Front  Office  Agent at  Cove  Hotel 5*  Paros, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring that our guests have an exceptional and memorable stay.  You will be the first point of contact for our guests, providing a warm and welcoming atmosphere and delivering outstanding customer service. Requirements: A degree in  Hospitality  Management Previous experience in a front office or guest service role is preferred Excellent communication and interpersonal skills Customer-focused with a genuine desire to exceed guest expectations Strong problem-solving abilities and attention to detail Knowledge of hotel management software Fluency in  English knowledge of additional languages is an advantage Benefits: Competitive salary and performance-based incentives Training and development opportunities Staff meals and accommodation benefits A supportive and friendly work environment Opportunities for career growth within a prestigious 5-star hotel brand', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
