(933920, 'Productivity International Consultant', 'https://www.jobfind.gr/JobAd/View/GR/Theseis_Ergasias/76254c2f-f10d-42c8-badc-3e64e0998790/', 'ΘΕΣΣΑΛΟΝΙΚΗ', '2026-04-28', '2026-04-28 09:00:17', 'BEDOR EXCEM', ' Περιγραφή  As a leading company in  Business  Re-engineering &  Productivity  Management,  Bedor  E X C E M  Group is looking for loyal and highly motivated people to participate in projects taking place in  Greece and abroad.  R E S P O N S I B I L I T I E S: As a  Consultant, you will participate in  Projects, where you will be responsible to:  Conduct  Operational and  Statistical studies Identify improvement opportunities in  Work  Processes,  Plan &  Control  Systems, and  Managerial  Skills Deploy  Action  Plans for the operational optimization of different organizational departments Implement new  Management  Systems and  Operating  Procedures Communicate and co-operate with executives at all levels of our client companies Work on different operational  Case  Studies, related to the business of our clients C A N D I D A T E  P R O F I L E: Engineering/ Finance  University background Two (2) years of working experience Fluency in  English Computer proficiency in  M S  Office Excellent communication Organizational and analytical skills Immediate availability Geographical flexibility W E  O F F E R: Challenging assignments and significant career development opportunities in a multinational environment On- and off-the-job trainings  Attractive remuneration package All applications will be handled in strict confidentiality.  Only short-listed candidates will be contacted.  Παροχές', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
